examples:
示例形式：
#include <typeinfo>

void speak(const Animal& animal) {
    if (typeid(animal) == typeid(Dog)) {
        cout << "Woof!" << endl;
    } else if (typeid(animal) == typeid(Bird)) {
        cout << "Chirp!" << endl;
    }
}

逻辑关系可写为：
$$
\operatorname{typeid}(animal)=
\begin{cases}
\operatorname{typeid}(Dog),&\text{输出 }\texttt{Woof!}\\
\operatorname{typeid}(Bird),&\text{输出 }\texttt{Chirp!}
\end{cases}
$$
